# estilex 0.1.0

* First release.

* Document retrieval (`etx_get_doc()`), text and provisions
  (`etx_get_text()`, `etx_get_paragraphs()`) and amendment history
  (`etx_get_references()`) from the Riigi Teataja public API.

* English translations (`etx_get_translation()`) and section-aligned
  parallel texts (`etx_get_parallel()`), which make translation fidelity
  measurable over time.

* Corpus enumeration from the open data archives
  (`etx_download_corpus()`, `etx_list_documents()`, `etx_list_archives()`,
  `etx_corpus_status()`, `etx_clear_corpus()`). Nothing is downloaded
  unless asked for.
